        "phon_confuse": 0.5,
        "phon_examples": "银/婴",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "下面我们就来介绍三款婴儿羹的做法。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 20.14,
      "end": 22.689,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "大家记下来，跟到一起做吧。",
      "score": 0.2029,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0835,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0841,
        "sc_delta": -0.0006,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.15,
        "seg_cer": 0.273,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "大家记下来，跟我们一起走吧。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 23.441,
      "end": 28.112,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "首先啊，我们要了解让银耳羹更加软糯香滑的小技巧。",
      "score": 0.1457,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0082,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0091,
        "sc_delta": -0.0009,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.136,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.333,
        "phon_examples": "银/婴",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "首先啊，我们要了解让婴儿更更加软糯香滑的小技巧。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 28.473,
      "end": 30.939,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "微微泛黄的银耳羹品质好，",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0025,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0028,
        "sc_delta": -0.0003,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "微微泛黄的银耳羹品质好。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 30.939,
      "end": 34.36,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "银耳的朵呢要小而且要密，这样子呢就容易煮。",
      "score": 0.5296,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1803,
        "sc_logprob": -0.166,
        "sc_delta": 0.0143,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.538,
        "seg_cer": 0.632,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.2,
        "phon_examples": "煮/组 子/之",
        "lexicon": "咧",
        "text_free": "营业额的多咧，要小而且要密，总之咧，就用一组。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 34.812,
      "end": 39.087,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "泡发的时候呢，可以用冷水，这样子可以更好的保留它的胶质。",
      "score": 0.1914,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0193,
        "sc_logprob": -0.022,
        "sc_delta": -0.0027,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.2,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.5,
        "phon_examples": "质/子 子/至",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "泡发的时候呢，可以用冷水，甚至可以更好的保留它的饺子。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 39.431,
      "end": 42.154,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "将银耳根部去掉，剪碎剁碎，",
      "score": 0.1884,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0484,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0548,
        "sc_delta": -0.0064,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.01,
        "seg_cer": 0.182,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.5,
        "phon_examples": "银/婴",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "将婴儿根部去掉，剪碎剁碎。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 42.154,
      "end": 44.851,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "或者用搅拌机搅得越碎越好，",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0042,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0054,
        "sc_delta": -0.0011,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "或者用搅拌机搅得越碎越好。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 44.851,
      "end": 48.631,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "这样子呢又可以省时间，煮出来的银耳会更加的浓。",
      "score": 0.1871,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
